A platform lists its PALS-BXOs (sys/pals); each PALS-BXO declares its own CBMs (sys/cbm in its repository). palsOfSys.cs plants, from those declarations, standard CBM leaves on the platform (sys/cbm/pals), which hold the host's gate and status. The CBM walk materializes each leaf through the CBS it points at, ending at the PALS's .internal site. A PALS-BXO not yet cloned is listed with its origin only.
